{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet Boom!</strong> is a fun and vibrant cartoon-style game for the whole family! Get ready for a burst of sweets and exciting battles in a colorful world where each map is themed around candies and sweets. Enjoy thrilling modes like battle royale, team battles, free-for-all, and unique trap-filled maps. Perfect for friendly evenings \u2014 team up in co-op, compete in multiplayer, and prove who the sweetest champion is! Are you ready to explode into fun? Let\u2019s go for victory in <strong>Sweet Boom!<br>What are you going to do?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced endless runner with multiple stages where you dash to the finish line and win.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/extras/70bc95e87eec0c9b777e3561b85bfc91.avif?t=1772026894\" width=800 height=530 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830070?t=1772026894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/7a60aefd2873342d46dbf758588fb711d0197de0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772026894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/5c53f106212dc99bdf77b4b4dc23b23686d8d716/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772026894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/5c53f106212dc99bdf77b4b4dc23b23686d8d716/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772026894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet Boom!</strong> is a fun and vibrant cartoon-style game for the whole family! Get ready for a burst of sweets and exciting battles in a colorful world where each map is the